{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Escape 9 to 5 is an hardcore climbing - parkour game.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Overworked and Underpaid,\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You try to escape your monotonous life and become someone better...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game challenges you to ascend from the confines of your office to the limitless skies above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fall, you lose all your progess,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>NO CHECKPOINTS!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>NO SECOND CHANCES!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>NO SAVING PROGRESS!</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each jump is a different challange. With practice and patience you can make it through.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through imaginative biomes each symbolizing a step away from corporate life. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every area offers unique obstacles and aesthetics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game supports only keyboard and mouse.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Windows only.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3817690?t=1757630407","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3817690?t=1757630407","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817690/545b7b63dcdd4dc9f38986fc32f8ba1e3474fc4d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757630407","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817690/545b7b63dcdd4dc9f38986fc32f8ba1e3474fc4d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757630407","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"descri